  <p id="c-xintangshu-116-xintang116:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-xintangshu-116-xintang116:p001:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAAAAA">王綝</persName>，字<persName id="c-xintangshu-116-xintang116:p001:m0004" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAAAAA">方慶</persName>，以字顯。其先自丹楊徙雍咸陽。父<persName id="c-xintangshu-116-xintang116:p001:m0022" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAAAA">弘直</persName>，為漢王元昌友。</p>
